Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.72,0:00:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,One wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.04,0:00:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want it, gotta go over the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting sail and heading for the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the\Nwinds and waves as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it up, never stopping, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm aiming to get there first, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.92,0:00:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all or nothing, no time to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it later, right now I'm living free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When your foes look like\Nthey will overwhelm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.56,0:00:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It means your heart's saying\Nthis is what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:00:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that to run is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're closed, I\Nfeel the satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm rude,\Nhere's my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.02,0:01:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When things are getting\Ntough, just gotta smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.88,0:01:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are going on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're looking for\Na fresh, brand new day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make sure your only\Nthought you have is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.94,0:01:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Moth maps will be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, with every step that you will take.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at all you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look ahead at new horizons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.22,0:01:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In view shining brightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.06,0:01:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, who knows what's waiting for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream living, that's the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Make like a hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, got to make your mark today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.06,0:01:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dreams don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.06,0:01:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Over the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.68,0:02:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.48,0:02:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.08,0:02:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now room
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.84,0:02:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and scan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.48,0:02:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I warned you, and you\Ndid it anyway. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.26,0:02:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They looked so good,\Nand I couldn't resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.68,0:02:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I going to die? What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.56,0:02:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But you will have the runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.90,0:02:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I told you not to\Neat the fish from the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.64,0:02:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it. Bad timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.22,0:02:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.34,0:03:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play cute with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.90,0:03:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Bunch of troublemakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.04,0:03:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not blow this Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.30,0:03:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Lay low.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They're rebels!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.22,0:03:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey boss, we got a group of\Nrebels here in the town square.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.46,0:03:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like that guy who killed\Nthe magistrate is with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.24,0:03:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry not, I'm on my way now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.48,0:03:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One of them has a straw\Nhat around his neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.08,0:03:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, do not engage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.74,0:03:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They are far too strong for you to defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.32,0:03:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you do that to our champion?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.70,0:03:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't even be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.50,0:03:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's carve him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.98,0:03:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing tama is the little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.40,0:04:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,General hold 'em took captive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.24,0:04:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You want her back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.72,0:04:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a sumo fight and\Nnow it's a sword fight. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.72,0:04:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.10,0:04:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Give her back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.08,0:04:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And he threw the damn scabbard again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.60,0:04:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sham!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.84,0:04:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.72,0:04:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough with the act.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.60,0:04:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You can take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.12,0:05:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying I should cut them down?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.22,0:05:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to save the\Nkid, don't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.06,0:05:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Horotama...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll rescue you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Give Tom a back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.92,0:05:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd bring it quick if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.26,0:05:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.94,0:06:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.48,0:06:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to be quite the commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.30,0:06:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.22,0:06:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it. That's shameful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Show your pride as a man of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.88,0:06:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it hurts, you mustn't carry on so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.82,0:07:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you start crying too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.58,0:07:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Alter to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.58,0:07:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.49,0:07:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my child! We need an herb!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.82,0:07:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They were hungry, and\Nthey drink from the river!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.94,0:07:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything just to fill their belly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.26,0:07:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come inside with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.00,0:08:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, time to collect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.34,0:08:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Put your harvest on the pallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.20,0:08:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.54,0:08:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Five silver?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.42,0:08:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're done, slink back to\NOkobori town and take the back way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.74,0:08:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I beg of you, I can't possibly feed\Nmy family on early fights over a week?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.58,0:08:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't even buy fresh\Nwater with this—who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.52,0:08:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.52,0:08:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,stop Touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.76,0:09:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your boss's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Oldema.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.98,0:09:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oldema.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.24,0:09:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oldema.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.15,0:09:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oldema. Oldema.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.36,0:09:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oldema.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.27,0:09:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oldema.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Boldema, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.26,0:09:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, there's a fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.84,0:09:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.14,0:09:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Call the firefighters!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.60,0:10:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You better keep your hands off\NTama, or I'm gonna make you pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.66,0:10:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.44,0:10:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Give Tama back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.16,0:10:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Boldama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.10,0:10:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here, so stop your damn yelling!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time, so you're the boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over Tama, Buldemur!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.74,0:10:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The name's Hold 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Buldemur?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.26,0:11:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick his ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.40,0:11:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You done hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.80,0:11:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't hide if I wanted to!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.22,0:11:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You destroyed my house with a\Ndamn sumo wrestler, no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.40,0:11:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if you were trying to use
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.20,0:11:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,urashima as a human missile\Nto destroy my house,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.02,0:11:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but you did a fine job of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.76,0:11:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.28,0:11:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Good
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.48,0:11:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I think I know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.32,0:11:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You work under that thief,\NShutenmaru, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.06,0:12:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But you should have known better\Nthan to screw with Bekori Town!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Shutenmaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.45,0:12:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Never heard of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.72,0:12:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your time right, playing dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.24,0:12:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way seems you're\Nhere for this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.10,0:12:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you'd better not move one full step,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.74,0:12:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll crush her bones in an instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.16,0:12:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.06,0:12:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.60,0:12:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,His stomach's a lion?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.26,0:12:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,General Hold 'em just showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.08,0:13:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's talking\Nto that Straw Hat guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.64,0:13:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I could break\Nout any minute, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.16,0:13:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.24,0:13:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You got any orders for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.70,0:13:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.24,0:13:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm at the town gate now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Hawkins is joining the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.72,0:13:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a big fire in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.82,0:13:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But what caused it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.74,0:13:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fading.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.52,0:13:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.14,0:13:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.66,0:13:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.02,0:13:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save you, Tama. Stay strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.32,0:13:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you think I'm just\Ngonna give her back?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.82,0:13:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How dumb are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.14,0:13:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.00,0:14:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.94,0:14:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Gate opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.38,0:14:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Another lovely display.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.14,0:14:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The selection today is delectable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.18,0:14:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, General Speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.16,0:14:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So would you like to examine the goods?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.00,0:14:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They're piled up right here behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.98,0:14:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.88,0:14:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My range of vision is 350 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.96,0:14:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even need to turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.86,0:14:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's horsepower!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.28,0:14:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.14,0:14:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That smile has horsepower, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.78,0:15:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire bell? Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.58,0:15:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.76,0:15:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We claim this fire in the name of Igory,\Nthe best firefighting squad in town!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.00,0:15:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.30,0:15:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop showing up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.06,0:15:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, this is Hold\N'em's mansion, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What caused all of this destruction?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.26,0:15:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look behind you, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.96,0:15:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.74,0:15:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I need to explain my\Nwide range of vision again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.88,0:16:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely the sumo event\Nwasn't the cause of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.12,0:16:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's amiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.28,0:16:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.40,0:16:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.66,0:16:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.96,0:16:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.48,0:16:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.82,0:16:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.86,0:16:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, will she?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.16,0:16:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And how are you going to save her? Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.12,0:16:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.64,0:16:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.04,0:16:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you move a single inch, it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.56,0:16:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a lion in my belly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.84,0:16:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,His name's Kami-jiro, and\Nhe's ready to start chomping!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.82,0:16:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.10,0:16:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to him, Otama!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.04,0:16:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, Boldama!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.48,0:17:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You let her go or I'll kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm scared of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.96,0:17:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even get my name right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.76,0:17:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's hold them by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.42,0:17:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.84,0:17:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,just keep running your mouth, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.28,0:17:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing you say is\Ngonna make me back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.70,0:17:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you want this stupid\Nbrat so bad in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.28,0:17:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're looking to use our\NDevil Fruit ability just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.36,0:17:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.52,0:17:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all gonna be my hostages soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.08,0:18:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Chutenmaru's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.46,0:18:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll come for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.22,0:18:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.08,0:18:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,this is worrisome give it up already he's
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.08,0:18:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,the head of your thief\Nbrigade and you know it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.00,0:18:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,those farm robberies have been a real pain
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,lately admit it they're\Nthe work of the atamayama
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.98,0:18:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,thieves brigade aren't they maybe it was
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.14,0:18:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,just dumb luck but you\Nbeat urashima somehow
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.62,0:18:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,that means you're probably\Nhigh ranking in the brigade
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.14,0:18:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,what are you talking about man\Nlufitado i don't know if it's wise to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.78,0:18:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,anger him in this situation he's\Npretty angry already though who cares
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,what i mean is that we don't\Nwant this matter to escalate
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.94,0:19:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's strong, but that's not my concern
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.34,0:19:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not Holden himself who strikes fear\Ninto the hearts of the citizens here
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.50,0:19:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the man above him
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.82,0:19:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A terrifying member of the Beast\NPirates One of Kaido's top officers
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.00,0:19:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The true ruler of Kuri Is Jack the Drought
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.50,0:19:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,wait we know him he's the guy who messed
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.20,0:19:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,up zo isn't he huh oh yeah that big creep
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.26,0:19:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,who poisoned king
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.28,0:19:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,cat and king dog but
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.44,0:19:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,that elephant kicked his ass in the end
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.26,0:20:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This ship got wrecked and\Nwe sank into the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got to be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.96,0:20:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Cat? Dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.58,0:20:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Elephant?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.00,0:20:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't mean that literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.50,0:20:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We heard Jack had a wreck at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.16,0:20:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's most certainly not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.88,0:20:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, he showed up here in\NBekori Town just a few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.84,0:20:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So, if we push too hard against\NHold 'em, then Jack retaliates.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.28,0:20:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The town will be left in ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.44,0:20:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He is known as a living\Ndisaster, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.44,0:20:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, we can't let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.46,0:20:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that supposed to be fair?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.08,0:21:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Jerks, you can't just hold the\Nwhole town hostage like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.74,0:21:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.76,0:21:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you guys going\Non about over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.52,0:21:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.10,0:21:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were going to\Ntake your little friend back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.10,0:21:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe kick my ass a bit? Oh, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.52,0:21:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one holding all the cards here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.54,0:21:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.22,0:21:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.52,0:21:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave her alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.14,0:21:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.56,0:21:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's some sweet music, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.98,0:21:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me some more!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.36,0:21:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The anguished cries of the lowly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.60,0:22:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're mad, remember,\Nthis is all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.44,0:22:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Should have thought twice\Nbefore you wrecked my house!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.34,0:22:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Hold 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.36,0:22:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You need some help or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.78,0:22:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The food treasure bar just rollin' in!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.66,0:22:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's grab our group, fellas!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.22,0:22:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.00,0:22:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I could go for a fief like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.78,0:22:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the supplies\Nfrom the Paradise Farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.24,0:22:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The water there is clean, so the\Nfood's delicious and safe to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.32,0:22:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it only for them?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.54,0:22:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.48,0:22:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you handle that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.74,0:23:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.76,0:23:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.14,0:23:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.96,0:23:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, short notice, but we're\Nstealing the food and running.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.68,0:23:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.59,0:23:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.46,0:23:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably going to\Npiss him off pretty bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.10,0:23:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but it beats smashing his face in, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.88,0:23:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.04,0:23:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hawkins is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.40,0:23:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We need your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.78,0:23:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy's too tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.34,0:23:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is Holden doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.30,0:23:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He's confronting the intruders\Nat the plaza in the 4th District!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.92,0:23:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not picking up, it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.32,0:23:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I'm going to have to\Nask you to stop, Basil Hawkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.34,0:24:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.25,0:24:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.08,0:24:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wano is closed off from\Nthe rest of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.22,0:24:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,With no information from the\Noutside, but Hawkins knows our faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.20,0:24:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to erase him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.90,0:24:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This next part will be fun for\Nme, at least not so much for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.92,0:24:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture one, but you can kill the rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.84,0:24:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it bloody!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.26,0:24:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Show them no mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.40,0:24:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.66,0:24:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, we have this brat as a hostage,\Nso I'd put that sword away if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.92,0:25:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.42,0:25:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll endanger her, otama!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.58,0:25:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's cold—decided\Nyou don't need the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.18,0:25:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Back after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.10,0:25:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.98,0:25:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, I'm sure Kamijito's\Ngrateful for the snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.38,0:25:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, chew her up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.88,0:25:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,up
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.10,0:25:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.36,0:25:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.38,0:25:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.98,0:25:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.86,0:25:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomijiro, you had one job, you dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.26,0:26:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.50,0:26:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.56,0:26:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.62,0:26:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry I kept you waiting so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.60,0:26:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to get a\Nflaming blade to the face!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.28,0:26:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's ever escaped my\Ntrick mechanism, sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.04,0:26:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And you won't be the first!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.38,0:26:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hellfire Ants Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.64,0:27:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.50,0:27:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.56,0:27:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.12,0:27:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.32,0:27:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think I'm lying,\Nyou're gonna be sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.26,0:27:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.34,0:27:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Put those swords down now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.42,0:27:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're reasonable after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.52,0:27:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.26,0:27:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.44,0:27:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move while I beat you to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.24,0:27:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Big lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.32,0:27:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.88,0:28:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you care about her,\Nyou heartless bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.70,0:28:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Dumb girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.74,0:28:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.18,0:28:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.02,0:28:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of your side. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.04,0:28:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.54,0:28:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.16,0:29:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.22,0:29:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.82,0:29:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My, what a gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.40,0:29:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened to your cheek?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.48,0:29:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh it's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.40,0:29:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It just got yanked on\Nby some pliers is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.34,0:29:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.56,0:29:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't make Cape\NDongle come out like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.24,0:30:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.30,0:30:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a second Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.38,0:30:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tired of running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.30,0:30:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay! I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.46,0:30:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.82,0:30:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Saving me was enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.76,0:30:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.66,0:30:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lionfire, it's time to roar!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.48,0:30:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, I'll finish you off!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.42,0:30:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got one more trick\Nto show, so don't blink!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.98,0:30:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.66,0:30:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Red Hawk!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.56,0:31:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
